+FR-02: sillyhub-daemon/tests/daemon-mission-worker-artifact.test.ts「pi(mcp=true，旧版宿主注入跳过形态) 成功轮：立即零代报；+90s 探测无 artifacts → 兜底代报（旧版 pi 宿主经延迟探测收敛，2026-10-12-pi-oldhost-fallback-pin）」
